\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Focus_Cape_0990d1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Shimmering%20Pearl\"><img alt=\"Giant Shimmering Pearl\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Giant_Shimmering_Pearl_ec8bf9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Leviathan's Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Leviathan_s_Amulet_9032bf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sea Serpent Area\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"67\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sea_Serpent_Area_acf8af.gif\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.20<br/>July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places and Loot <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Sea Serpent Area</b> is split into two locations west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Hrodmir\">Hrodmir</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31929,31069,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (31929, 31069, 8)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31931,31251,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (31931, 31251, 9)</a>).\nYou can get there with <a href=\"#/wiki/Captain%20Haba\">Captain Haba</a>. You will need Diving Equipment (i.e. either a <a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a> or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\">Depth Galea</a>) to dive underwater; once underwater, you can remove the helmet but lacking full drown resistance will incur the usual Drown Damage.\n</p><p>There are 3 floors in the first area. On the first floor there are <a href=\"#/wiki/Deepsea%20Blood%20Crab\">Deepsea Blood Crabs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Young%20Sea%20Serpent\">Young Sea Serpents</a>, along with at least 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent\">Sea Serpents</a> spawns.  You can <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a> or use <a href=\"#/wiki/Parcel\">Parcels</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pot\">Pots</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Cube\">Ice Cubes</a> to get down to levels -2 and -3 to fight <a href=\"#/wiki/Young%20Sea%20Serpent\">Young Sea Serpent</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent\">Sea Serpents</a> in a dozen or so pits. Some of the pits have caves so beware that there can be more serpents present than you can see from above. It was said a profitable hunt here was hard before Updates/8.5, as <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent\">Sea Serpents</a> droped little loot whose price was stable.\n</p><p>You will need to have completed <a href=\"#/quest/the-hunt-for-the-sea-serpent-quest\">The Hunt for the Sea Serpent Quest</a> in order to access these hunting grounds.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sor